  "result": "I made three changes to fix both seat problems. I haven't run the test suite.\n\n- **Recount:** `recomputeUsage` in `repositories/usage-repository.ts` now counts only members that are `active` and not archived. Before, it counted every member row, including removed ones.\n- **Immediate release on removal:** `registerUsageListeners` in `services/usage-service.ts` now subscribes to `member.removed` and decrements `seatsUsed` by 1. Only `member.joined` moved the counter before.\n- **Invitations:** `countPendingInvitations` in `repositories/invitation-repository.ts` now also excludes revoked invitations. Only invitations that are neither accepted nor revoked hold a seat.\n\nRe-sending an invitation needed no separate change. `resendInvitation` revokes the old invitation before calling `inviteMember`, so the corrected count no longer includes it. A workspace that is actually full is still refused.",
